  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> for <math><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>π,</mi></math> then the number of values of the pair <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>max</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>⁡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />and <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, LHS <math><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and RHS <math><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, the possibility of equality is only when<br />LHS <math><mo>=</mo></math> RHS <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />RHS <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />LHS <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>⇒</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> There are four values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> and hence four pairs of&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
